  ]\n },\n \"states\": [],\n \"cfg\": [],\n \"html\": \"<div class=\\\"module our-services\\\"> <h2 class=\\\"title module-title\\\" id=\\\"services\\\">Services</h2> <div class=\\\"services-main-description module-description\\\">Streamlined services delivering exceptional results: uniquely crafted stories, industry-leading brands, and powerful software.</div> <div class=\\\"services\\\"> <div class=\\\"tabs\\\"> <span class=\\\"active\\\">Storytelling</span> <span>Design</span> <span>Workshops</span> <span>Product Innovation</span> </div> <div class=\\\"services-dropdown\\\"> <select name=\\\"\\\" id=\\\"\\\"> <option selected=\\\"\\\" value=\\\"storytelling\\\">Storytelling</option> <option value=\\\"design\\\">Design</option> <option value=\\\"workshops\\\">Workshops</option> <option value=\\\"product innovation\\\">Product Innovation</option> </select> </div> <div class=\\\"services-slider flickity-enabled is-draggable\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"> <div class=\\\"flickity-viewport\\\" style=\\\"height: 608px; touch-action: pan-y;\\\"><div class=\\\"flickity-slider\\\" style=\\\"left: 0px; transform: translateX(0%);\\\"><div class=\\\"services-slider-item slide is-selected\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0px; transform: translateX(0%);\\\"> <div class=\\\"description\\\"> <p>Stories and experiences bring people together. They inspire them to see the world<span>—</span>and your organization<span>—</span>differently. We work with you to define opportunities and bring ideas to life. By digging into what matters most to you and your organization, we learn how to craft stories and experiences that engage your visitors, spur them to action, and help them fall in love with what you do.</p> <a class=\\\"hs-button\\\" href=\\\"https://freerange.com/services?hsLang=en#storytelling\\\">Learn More</a> </div> <img src=\\\"https://freerange.com/hubfs/Free%20Range/Hearst-Museum---Cultures-Connect.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"> </div><div class=\\\"services-slider-item slide\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0px; transform: translateX(100%);\\\"> <div class=\\\"description\\\"> <p>Good design enriches our world, improves our lives, and makes easy communication possible. We rely on robust design thinking to help us create beautiful work, support meaningful causes, and spread inspiring media.</p> <a class=\\\"hs-button\\\" href=\\\"https://freerange.com/services?hsLang=en#design\\\">Learn More</a> </div> <img src=\\\"https://freerange.com/hubfs/Free%20Range/Lithium-B3D.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"> </div><div class=\\\"services-slider-item slide\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0px; transform: translateX(200%);\\\"> <div class=\\\"description\\\"> <p>Our one-of-a-kind workshops teach you how to find the story that powers your brand, and tell it in a way that draws people to your cause. By rooting your brand in archetype and story structure, you will learn how to understand its past, direct its present—and bring about its remarkable future.&nbsp;</p> <a class=\\\"hs-button\\\" href=\\\"https://freerange.com/services?hsLang=en#workshops\\\">Learn More</a> </div> <img src=\\\"https://freerange.com/hubfs/Free%20Range/Microsoft-%26-Tipping-Point-Combined-Graphic.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"> </div><div class=\\\"services-slider-item slide\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0px; transform: translateX(300%);\\\"> <div class=\\\"description\\\"> <p>We specialize in creating applications and websites that are friendly and intuitive (UX) with appealing visuals (UI) that can be scaled into robust business solutions. Our detail-oriented project managers work closely with our team of developers who write clean semantic&nbsp;code and provide great technical documentation—helping you create pleasant user experiences and professional, innovative products.</p> <a class=\\\"hs-button\\\" href=\\\"https://freerange.com/services?hsLang=en#product-innovation\\\">Learn More</a> </div> <img src=\\\"https://freerange.com/hubfs/Free%20Range/Nature-Conservancy---Connected-mobile.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"> </div></div></div></div> </div> </div>\"\n}"